            "description": "",
            "summary": "WisdomTree (WT) posted revenue growth of 10.2% per year, narrowly lagging the broader US market\u2019s 10.3% forecast. EPS is set to climb 14.5% annually, also coming in just under the market\u2019s 15.9% pace, and recent data reflect a notable $35.5 million non-recurring loss that cut net profit margins to 13.4% from 18.9% a year earlier. With shares trading at $11.96, investors are weighing the company\u2019s steady but slower growth, margin compression, and elevated valuation multiples against forecasts...",
